00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:22.338
Banyak keajaiban.

00:06:23.214 --> 00:06:24.549
Kau tahu apa soal Cyrus?

00:06:25.591 --> 00:06:26.843
Dia satu-satunya.

00:06:27.677 --> 00:06:29.804
